# There is no API address to set here: the app reads it at run time from the page that
# serves it (`window.__WEBAPP_CONFIG__`, injected by the FastAPI webapp controller), so it
# follows the deployment rather than the machine that ran `vite build`.
# (VITE_MARKDOWN_API_URL is no longer used.)

# NOTE: there is deliberately no VITE_MARKDOWN_ADMIN_KEY. The admin key is
# checked by the backend (MARKDOWN_ADMIN_KEY) against what the user types;
# putting it here would compile it into the JavaScript every visitor downloads.
